{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c2b9d38-db0e-11ef-8e58-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c2b9d2a-db0e-11ef-8a05-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"銀州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[{"chapter_global_index":1,"chapter_name":"本朝篇第一","chenzhu_chapter":"本朝谓父母国。人莫不有父母国，观其对本朝之称呼，即知其对父母国之厚薄。胡身之今本《通鉴注》，撰于宋亡以後，故《四库提要》称之为元人。然观其对宋朝之称呼，实未尝一日忘宋也。大抵全书自四十卷至二百三十二卷之间，恒称宋为“我朝”或“我宋”，而前後则率称“宋”或“宋朝”，吾颇疑为元末镂板时所改，其作内词者，身之原文也。试顺全书卷次，条举其例如下：","chenzhu_index_in_chapter":22,"chenzhu_text":"全注称宋为“我朝”者，至此而止。以后悉称“宋朝”，或单称“宋”，不具举。","created_at":"2025-12-31 08:50:44","seq_in_chapter":93,"tongjian_id":"CH01-CZ022"}],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"托跋","people_name_jianti_auto":"托跋","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"c1093a32-db0e-11ef-b32d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"拓跋","people_name_jianti_auto":"拓跋","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"c1093a33-db0e-11ef-964a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鮮卑","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲜卑","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c1093a34-db0e-11ef-95f7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"c1093a35-db0e-11ef-885b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"c1093a36-db0e-11ef-a094-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"党項","place_name_jianti_auto":"党项","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"c1093a37-db0e-11ef-a02e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西夏","place_name_jianti_auto":"西夏","start_index":58,"tongjian_id":"c1093a38-db0e-11ef-9752-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"托，與拓同。托跋起於鮮卑之裔，自謂托天而生，拔地而長，故以爲姓，此後魏所本者也。若唐時党項諸部，亦自有拓跋一姓，我朝西夏其後也。夏，戶雅翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"托，与拓同。托跋起于鲜卑之裔，自谓托天而生，拔地而长，故以为姓，此后魏所本者也。若唐时党项诸部，亦自有拓跋一姓，我朝西夏其后也。夏，户雅翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"c1093a31-db0e-11ef-828d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c1093a3a-db0e-11ef-a6be-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"周武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"周武帝","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"c1093a3b-db0e-11ef-a437-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"銀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"银州","place_note":"陕西省榆林市南鱼河堡","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"c1093a3c-db0e-11ef-a91d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"c1093a3d-db0e-11ef-b02e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西河郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"西河郡","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"c1093a3e-db0e-11ef-b4bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"圁陰縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"圁阴县","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"c1093a3f-db0e-11ef-b40a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"銀防","place_name_jianti_auto":"银防","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"c1093a40-db0e-11ef-990e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"銀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"银州","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"c1093a41-db0e-11ef-80ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏州","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏州","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"c1093a42-db0e-11ef-98bf-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"麟州","place_name_jianti_auto":"麟州","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"c1093a43-db0e-11ef-972c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"宋白曰：銀州，漢爲西河郡圁陰縣地，周武帝保定二年，於縣城置銀防，三年，置銀州，因谷爲名。舊有人收驄馬於此谷，虜語驄馬爲乞銀，故名；西北至夏州二百三十里，北至麟州三百里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宋白曰：银州，汉为西河郡圁阴县地，周武帝保定二年，于县城置银防，三年，置银州，因谷为名。旧有人收骢马于此谷，虏语骢马为乞银，故名；西北至夏州二百三十里，北至麟州三百里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"c1093a39-db0e-11ef-8598-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"銀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"银州","place_note":"陕西省榆林市南鱼河堡","resolved_place_entity_id":1874,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"c1093a47-db0e-11ef-86b3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"元和十一年，度支盐铁使言：银川水甘草丰，请置银川监。开成...","context_before":"...复置银州，治儒林县。天宝初，曰银川郡。乾元初，复曰银州。","source_end_index":214,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a9b39675-b439-5cc9-83f4-0995e2a6e370","source_start_index":182,"source_text":"贞元二年，吐蕃取盐夏州，又寇银州。州素无城，吏民皆溃，转陷麟州。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/五、延安府（卷五十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十一、宁夏卫（卷六十二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"。八年，收复[明年，置盐州节度，寻废。十七年，又陷于吐蕃...","context_before":"...于旧城置盐州及五原县]。天宝初，曰五原郡。乾元初，复故。","source_end_index":188,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f794a46e-ab36-55e8-861c-561ae5994299","source_start_index":163,"source_text":"贞元二年，陷于吐蕃[《唐史》：时吐蕃陷盐州及夏州]"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十一、宁夏卫（卷六十二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"19吐蕃又寇夏州，亦令刺史托跋乾暉帥衆去，遂據其城。又寇銀州，州素無城，吏民皆潰；吐蕃亦棄之，又陷麟州。","content_fanyi":"吐蕃军队又进犯夏州，也让夏州刺史托跋乾晖带领夏州军民撤离，随后占领了夏州城。吐蕃军队又进犯银州，银州素来没有城墙，官吏和百姓都溃散了；吐蕃也放弃了银州，又攻陷了麟州。","content_jianti_auto":"19吐蕃又寇夏州，亦令刺史托跋干晖帅众去，遂据其城。又寇银州，州素无城，吏民皆溃；吐蕃亦弃之，又陷麟州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":23400,"number":19,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百三十二 (唐紀四十八) / 德宗神武聖文皇帝七 / 二年 / 第 26 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"c1093a30-db0e-11ef-8433-a0d3651f611f","year_int":786},"tongjian_id":"c1093a30-db0e-11ef-8433-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"銀州","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"契苾何力","people_name_jianti_auto":"契苾何力","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"c44a270e-db0e-11ef-a317-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"太宗","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"c44a270f-db0e-11ef-90a1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"契苾","place_name_jianti_auto":"契苾","place_note":"九姓部落之一","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"c44a2710-db0e-11ef-93b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"振武","place_name_jianti_auto":"振武","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"c44a2711-db0e-11ef-932e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"契苾種帳，太和中附於振武；契苾何力，太宗時來朝，遂留宿衞。蔚，紆勿翻。契，欺訖翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"契苾种帐，太和中附于振武；契苾何力，太宗时来朝，遂留宿衞。蔚，纡勿翻。契，欺讫翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"c44a270d-db0e-11ef-89ad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"c44a270c-db0e-11ef-816a-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"bì","source_anchor_text":"忠請與契苾沙陀吐谷","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":8,"text":"苾","tongjian_id":"04ad305b-cab7-5b04-b713-f09409c2f500"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"銀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"银州","place_note":"陕西省榆林市南鱼河堡","resolved_place_entity_id":1874,"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"c44a271c-db0e-11ef-bbcd-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"15李思忠請與契苾、沙陀、吐谷渾六千騎合勢擊回鶻。乙巳，以銀州刺史何清朝、蔚州刺史契苾通分將河東蕃兵詣振武，受李思忠指揮。通，何力之五世孫。","content_fanyi":"李思忠请求与契苾、沙陀、吐谷浑共同带领六千骑兵，合力进攻回鹘。乙巳日，即九月十四日，命令银州刺史何清朝、蔚州刺史契苾通分别率领河东蕃兵赶赴振武，接受李思忠指挥。契苾通是契苾何力的五世孙。","content_jianti_auto":"15李思忠请与契苾、沙陀、吐谷浑六千骑合势击回鹘。乙巳，以银州刺史何清朝、蔚州刺史契苾通分将河东蕃兵诣振武，受李思忠指挥。通，何力之五世孙。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":25095,"number":15,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二百四十六 (唐紀六十二) / 武宗至道昭肅孝皇帝上 / 二年 / 第 30 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"c44a270c-db0e-11ef-816a-a0d3651f611f","year_int":842},"tongjian_id":"c44a270c-db0e-11ef-816a-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":2},"place_name":"銀州"},"message":"success","success":true}